  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-8c66db3b-9c14-404b-8cf4-dfbb20fe4ea9\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-91c9732c-2c7e-44a3-81b0-403200cb6fc4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7d332eff-adb5-4cba-85c5-5f4faaabba1c\">무슨 일을 시작할 때 가장 고통스러운 일 하나를 뽑으라고 한다면 포맷을 만드는 것이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a53d08b-2d7a-49d6-af17-dd1bbf7788cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-53937720-9d5b-424e-8bc4-c077d5f209fd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a4203c96-e314-487b-b587-e3ff240dc559\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-edbd7a7f-25b0-4805-8f13-75b48969caeb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7f72db8d-107d-4102-8a5e-6d2bfd557bf3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7102ce18-0994-4059-9984-cf4fef49b0d1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-32c67041-77d6-4f15-90f2-d83e653cb017\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-84432aaa-9bf2-43d3-a30a-c1c2f07d3085\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a69410b2-c3dd-4e02-9072-a6dc07697c1f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5a804960-2fed-4602-b163-92339840fc5c\">주는사란을 시작하기 전에 유튜브를 3번 말아먹었다. 정확히 표현하자면 하다가 말았다. 영상을 2개 올렸는데 구독자가 4명 밖에 안되는 사실을 받아들이기 힘들었다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ba7fb0f2-e62a-469d-9519-36134a9bb3cc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-99c60f11-d490-47b9-8cf6-91ec66c126e5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ea2daaea-818b-431e-938f-45104c095b9f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8ed28465-672f-4f5e-bc80-6472767891db\">아직도 남아있다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-27fb061c-b59d-464a-9db0-34833ed172c6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:596px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-27fb061c-b59d-464a-9db0-34833ed172c6\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMTRfMTA4/MDAxNzMxNTYzMzA3OTgz.x_IOZ5NQ9RoUxc214SZ3ReMUnLI1Z-PZB2Cpt5yQYEcg.dovbvmxDJRzM2yWHDAHLgraqCDLx6DNcCNvrZg1Uflkg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"596\", \"originalHeight\" : \"544\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMTRfMTA4/MDAxNzMxNTYzMzA3OTgz.x_IOZ5NQ9RoUxc214SZ3ReMUnLI1Z-PZB2Cpt5yQYEcg.dovbvmxDJRzM2yWHDAHLgraqCDLx6DNcCNvrZg1Uflkg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f40682c7-9344-4c10-b0a4-15de2a4640c8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ae6bd037-1322-44f9-bc6b-df91839550ae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1f5855b3-7dea-42a6-849f-cd9362948dac\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f932a040-217b-4556-9eb5-27f856ef187e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7587f2e2-6aa9-4523-ba11-b4bc08169605\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b585894d-e186-47f5-85b8-da9949306ce4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f391e767-5669-441a-acd8-e0cef50f3986\">그래서 주는사란때는 도중에 멈추는걸 막기 위해 영상 10개를 찍고 그 뒤로부터 올리기 시작했다. 참고로 영상 10개를 찍는데 6개월 넘게 걸렸다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-07cb2df5-df96-4538-8457-51ac7fc72701\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-04f56b6b-7f03-4d09-8715-864db6664e1d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b262eb11-fcc0-49cb-a10d-5e8d971e3aad\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ba3aebdd-2de3-4613-8ddf-37737ae6ba86\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-756f0d0b-b814-4df3-836d-697b2be20a56\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6d16dba3-bdcf-4eac-a5e3-f6a54aa70e7b\">물론 나중에 알게된건데 영상 2개에 이정도 조회수에 구독자 4명이면 엄청난 수치다. 주는사란은 영상 3개 올렸을때도 구독자 0명이었다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-imageStrip se-imageStrip2 se-l-default\" id=\"SE-edd602f7-7976-4079-80be-8d4508ea9314\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-imageStrip se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-imageStrip-container se-imageStrip-col-2\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"width:65.93707171234104%;\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-400176dc-c9a9-47a6-963d-e0f13cabfe2f\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA4MDVfODgg/MDAxNzIyODM1OTM4MzEz.3ITIkkOtUhmZXuwvA0B3W2K2s6wLku2uoDqi-C4P610g.ySVTBKoEwSaLnIbWpAkFsDX2od2kiLB4kQQJ7iTUfAIg.PNG/image.png?type=w1600\", \"originalWidth\" : \"637\", \"originalHeight\" : \"296\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA4MDVfODgg/MDAxNzIyODM1OTM4MzEz.3ITIkkOtUhmZXuwvA0B3W2K2s6wLku2uoDqi-C4P610g.ySVTBKoEwSaLnIbWpAkFsDX2od2kiLB4kQQJ7iTUfAIg.PNG/image.png?type=w1600\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"width:34.062928287658956%;\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-c0bc238e-bba9-42c8-baf8-a77d8217e49c\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA4MDVfMjgw/MDAxNzIyODM0MzUwNDg5.Z4SiEHqBGrdWHKWbCvsXgXQtlYUgjixAFwfqEJuC7FQg.l71cztZXgMIKcAQMIHzbvE7v67ZlKpMXjFXuK_F0N1Yg.PNG/image.png?type=w1600\", \"originalWidth\" : \"199\", \"originalHeight\" : \"179\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA4MDVfMjgw/MDAxNzIyODM0MzUwNDg5.Z4SiEHqBGrdWHKWbCvsXgXQtlYUgjixAFwfqEJuC7FQg.l71cztZXgMIKcAQMIHzbvE7v67ZlKpMXjFXuK_F0N1Yg.PNG/image.png?type=w1600\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-135aae4a-b35b-418f-a174-dc9b450e53eb\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ab92fb16-c3df-47cf-96b5-030b6f51a970\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-19274d6f-49bf-4c8d-bdfa-9a0271ed9847\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eac24f74-b30f-49db-914b-f9b87b15ce65\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cbc99952-39bf-4636-bfad-6541b6c2fcc6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5376926e-a038-4d6b-b52c-65141ceb4de7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f9b7dc06-aed8-48da-891b-2bbc63962f6f\">도중에 포기하게 되는 가장 큰 이유로는 2가지가 있다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e1dfa6de-34ad-4a74-a71a-6aaf3871bdf9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0983c8a6-4172-4514-8a0f-396f059184f7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c2c5116-001c-48a8-898c-e403d03e9e4c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-88a9892c-e7b6-4eed-a018-c0aaa3744a18\">1. 된다는 확신이 없다는 것  </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d51dca1c-8cc9-49c6-ba73-f63e8543d414\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5f9116df-d7b3-40ee-8fa2-c580aec4f7ec\">2. 어떻게 해야할지 생각할게 너무 많다는것 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f043779-1ed8-499e-8fec-802b27330e9e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-eb4e1da1-52eb-4f15-a7cc-34b8721a04a1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-74610cc9-1ad3-473d-8421-8b01aa6653d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-85356beb-69bf-4d1d-a798-54dd6fb1feea\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-15b8fa5c-6682-49cb-bde7-b8a924ae08cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4f4fee62-53db-4250-b9aa-15eb13feec67\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-472b0eed-2794-4da7-a8b1-42c3a5706cf1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-080f971c-ffd0-40ac-863b-0bab41c31bae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-87f40fb2-808d-4981-85e9-a30daa028efa\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a4e80bff-4b0c-42cb-9b95-7d80fb6fdb4f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f8866a9b-ab81-4b09-b00b-ff9ce535a8dd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8ac69b91-479c-4978-8f9f-bdc2e28ae339\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5795e9e3-f3f2-4522-b5d0-5d446d0cb2f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9125e934-fc50-407c-a31d-ef868c4e1435\">개인적으로 2번이 요즘 나를 괴롭히고 있다.  요즘 새로운 유튜브를 하고 있다. 나는 이미 유튜브가 된다는걸 너무 잘 알고 있다. (1번 해결) 근데도 하기가 너무 어렵다. 왜냐면 어떤 컨셉으로 어떤 내용을 어떻게 말할건지 처음부터 다 짜야된다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bbcec817-eadb-4902-b230-1268e12ddda9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e7e7bb04-87dc-4da8-a046-949f5436d3dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6b96a978-8103-4343-b2d7-f899639d771f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d70cd9e1-3fde-461a-884a-3d5c12e22746\">이 과정에서 너무 머리를 많이 쓰게 된다. 심지어 며칠간 감기때문에 고생했는데 감기약을 먹고 자는 그 순간에도 대본 서론에 어떤 내용을 써야 할지 계속 고민됐다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0fa567f0-1cfd-47aa-a198-7d7c29b6ce2b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-abd637ad-47ba-42b2-8029-4207cda8b8c0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-126ae43e-7714-4c36-8d59-11b621118a15\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-68122f8a-9c10-495e-9c74-a529d77c4642\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-29c80dff-97ec-4436-9542-36b2ff82127f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5650fd53-53b7-4381-a84c-126fe4f03b57\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27730a7c-d611-491c-81fd-9af55e36be5e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-40b5d4fb-762e-490b-9857-63af8cff3a16\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-68e3e451-aee6-433e-8618-bea04fed5522\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9d33bb2f-aa09-4a2e-9766-11dcbf846a08\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-813e5708-08e4-4be1-8968-52a003f3c7da\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e77b51be-4b1d-4580-9d2e-ee3134b2fd2d\">지금은 주는사란 영상 하나 만드는데 2일정도 걸린다. 근데 새로운 유튜브에 영상 하나를 만드는데는 일주일 내내 고민해도 시작도 못할때도 많다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ac96896b-7876-48d0-a91f-ef7302b1504c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-19bbd556-42db-4f66-a2b8-9aaccedf3d2c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-08562f1a-1e8c-497f-81de-e8a9b196ef58\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d0c22c74-265b-42d0-9986-a7bbc42b1f70\">요즘 새 유튜브가 알고리즘을 제대로 타서 구독자도 엄청 늘고 있고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d2f6fa07-bc43-4c61-a052-d02d86ebc914\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-defau